[{"title":"春闺怨","author":"谢与思","text":"独拂妆台理玉颜，落花无语伴春阑。\n昨宵失记相思梦，朝见啼痕满袖班。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17392,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中与人对酌","author":"谢与思","text":"东风江上送兰舟，两岸残红夹水流。\n今日尊前见春尽，可怜同醉不同愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17393,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得云机","author":"谢与思","text":"朝来云气傍危楼，少妇开帘结远愁。\n近得仙郎教玉笛，一声声似怨清秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17394,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔歌","author":"谢与思","text":"几处渔灯隐月明，有时风送唱歌声。\n吾生不用咨詹尹，已解沧浪笑独醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17395,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖巾子山楼","author":"谢与思","text":"危楼閒倚太湖西，春日花明柳荫堤。\n莫遣画船歌舞散，傍人山鬼夜深啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17396,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道值旧识潮予策䮿之官口占答之","author":"谢与思","text":"楼头少妇厌浓妆，对坐菱花脱玉珰。\n姊姒不知怜素质，却疑羞涩便缘郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17397,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行经汶上堕马复誇驰数十里赋二绝解嘲 其一","author":"谢与思","text":"按辔溪头弄夕阳，霜蹄骄卧藉群芳。\n角巾不乱青云色，误使佳人拟艳妆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17398,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行经汶上堕马复誇驰数十里赋二绝解嘲 其二","author":"谢与思","text":"十里花香真泥马，一鞭秋色欲沾衣。\n知章落井梁王死，肯信书生控似飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17399,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过雨道上忆及仙鬼有能诗者戏拟二首 其一","author":"谢与思","text":"夜半乾坤雨洗沙，苍山万点是吾家。\n偶然爱弄秋江色，笑泛一枝芙蓉花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17400,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过雨道上忆及仙鬼有能诗者戏拟二首 其二","author":"谢与思","text":"雨过桥根水齧沙，浮云漠漠不知家。\n蝉喉叫涩行人断，赤脚循溪嗅豆花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17401,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和王道坚月中桂赠庄生","author":"谢与思","text":"寒空玉魄映长流，帘捲香传桂影浮。\n万籁坐来浑已寂，不知蝴蝶梦庄周。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17402,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏作仆夫乐","author":"谢与思","text":"北来南去客如麻，陌上长驱及暮霞。\n倦即停鞭唱荷叶，得钱沽酒不论家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17403,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题仙人奕棋图","author":"谢与思","text":"石上藤萝绣作盘，仙人于此岁华宽。\n留将一着先天秘，恐与深山魍魉看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17404,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏题卢奚便面","author":"谢与思","text":"雪中香送海棠花，几度看花倒紫霞。\n为笑春妍题社燕，风流终自属卢家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17405,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题扇画","author":"谢与思","text":"空江半夜春水长，隔窗木叶满山响。\n冲流一片渔舠轻，蓑笠飘飘曳难上。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17406,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题","author":"谢与思","text":"江南三月百花新，十里香风夹水滨。\n顾作游蜂采成蜜，分甜先到美人唇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17407,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春宫怨","author":"谢与思","text":"闻道春游玉辇骄，阶前芳草向人消。\n不知妾貌能如昨，镜里双眉久未描。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17408,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春闺怨","author":"谢与思","text":"门掩寒花翠幌孤，章台犹自纵呼卢。\n妾今但畏长衫薄，莫问封侯事有无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17409,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青楼怨","author":"谢与思","text":"指上冰弦湿未调，白头司马恨难消。\n空将南陌如丝柳，折送行人度洛桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17410,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画荷","author":"谢与思","text":"剜剜新妆翠袖开，洛川魂梦使人猜。\n玉颜寂寞啼秋雨，似忆陈王作赋才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17411,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花朝","author":"谢与思","text":"芳春何事恨难消，面面青山对寂寥。\n五斗欲将沽酒去，满城风雨妒花朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17412,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"少年行","author":"谢与思","text":"酒满金瓶花满楼，胡姬十五据床头。\n坐中慷慨谁家子，泪应商歌湿蒯缑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17413,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠二歌者","author":"谢与思","text":"弱柳双双度晓莺，当尊残月拂波明。\n座中客自悲将别，好为殷勤唱渭城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17414,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"琅□山亭与朱生酌口占","author":"谢与思","text":"悲歌慷慨气横秋，酒尽山亭落日愁。\n为问平原祢处士，醉来肝胆好谁投。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17415,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送别家弟","author":"谢与思","text":"银烛双垂午夜花，尊前离思托琵琶。\n高歌一曲愁行路，到处苍山未是家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17416,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题 其一","author":"谢与思","text":"坐对华灯引浊醪，空庭寒色入绨袍。\n相怜不作经年别，莫遣迥文织锦劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17417,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题 其二","author":"谢与思","text":"城头鼓角动微寒，绣户香传烛影残。\n醉里不知身是客，双清梅月倚帘看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17418,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"口占别廖君文冈","author":"谢与思","text":"如君官罢一身轻，我亦今抛世上名。\n临别授君云水趣，管教颔底黑须生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17419,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得浣纱女","author":"谢与思","text":"西施自爱浣春纱，误入吴宫醉月华。\n艳色不缘金屋贵，五湖烟树是侬家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17420,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过天长县","author":"谢与思","text":"官河迢递绕城斜，西渡疏林落酒家。\n倦客偶然成一醉，冷风吹醒又乘车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17421,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"醉歌","author":"谢与思","text":"赋就归来一酒徒，白云秋色总堪呼。\n那能饱尽长安米，老向君王乞鉴湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17422,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饮百尺楼赠歌者二绝 其一","author":"谢与思","text":"文犀高绾鬓如鸦，玉立亭亭引盼斜。\n却向晚风歌一阕，楼前妒杀海棠花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17423,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饮百尺楼赠歌者二绝 其二","author":"谢与思","text":"密坐新牵白苧衣，话来玉屑转霏霏。\n纤喉可待周郎顾，六月浮云冻不飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17424,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得赛玉赠人 其一","author":"谢与思","text":"谁家白练步盈盈，映坐朱颜玉琢成。\n莫道蒹葭堪并倚，倾城元自重连城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17425,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得赛玉赠人 其二","author":"谢与思","text":"采从元圃色青葱，曲度庭花袅幔风。\n此日目成怜楚客，何人肠断恼司空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17426,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画四绝即席赋 其一","author":"谢与思","text":"新妆冉冉出空波，翠羽矜妍妒绮罗。\n为寄洛川神女道，陈王词赋思如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17427,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画四绝即席赋 其二","author":"谢与思","text":"石上萝生翠自幽，杏花无语对凉飕。\n裁将杂佩堪持赠，解却长门一段愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17428,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画四绝即席赋 其三","author":"谢与思","text":"渔郎捕鱼鱼尾赤，市中粥鱼一盈尺。\n谁怜白发倚岩翁，独向流波钓钩直。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17429,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画四绝即席赋 其四","author":"谢与思","text":"木叶乱脱飞银涛，馀皇箫鼓何嘈嘈。\n郎今莫渡且归去，灵岩如屋苍天高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17430,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春茗","author":"谢与思","text":"为爱天池谷雨芽，中冷鲜水沦山家。\n墨乡莫恨诗肠渴，散作毫端五色花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17431,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹿葱","author":"谢与思","text":"眉间翠黛澹能扫，望舒夕圆人不老。\n纤喉度曲唤客欢，君若有愁佩萱草。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17432,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瑞兰","author":"谢与思","text":"鬒发娇歌出洞房，却怜纤手送霞觞。\n坐中若问侬名字，楚佩由来重国香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17433,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春桃","author":"谢与思","text":"昨夜东风开碧桃，一枝浓艳映青袍。\n花间作赋君休讶，寻着仙源客自豪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17434,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏题","author":"谢与思","text":"白发看花不羡仙，一双金屋贮婵娟。\n琴心未识狂司马，老嫁商人镇独眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17435,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳词十七首 其一","author":"谢与思","text":"雪洞春光碧海深，青衫长对紫霞斟。\n灯前射覆拈纤手，坐到层城漏欲沉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17436,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳词十七首 其二","author":"谢与思","text":"署倚青山石溜清，晓来分入曲池平。\n风吹莲叶游鱼上，自扱香纶绕槛行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17437,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳词十七首 其三","author":"谢与思","text":"游丝轻飏午窗虚，疏簟风和籍袖馀。\n洗沐不随群伴出，案头时唤检文书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17438,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳词十七首 其四","author":"谢与思","text":"湘帘秋静早休衙，睡冷珊瑚歛鬓鸦。\n一夜天风飞玉露，庭前开遍木犀花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17439,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳词十七首 其五","author":"谢与思","text":"几回长路拥行骖，向夕孤蓬古剑浑。\n玉醴调来亲捧进，相怜还劝慎烟岚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17440,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳词十七首 其六","author":"谢与思","text":"灵岩杰阁敞仙都，乘兴閒携选□壶。\n水骨却嫌萝径绝，回头多是倩人扶。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17441,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳词十七首 其七","author":"谢与思","text":"惆怅黄花病骨侵，风霜尤自伴抽簪。\n难将明月珠千颗，买得蛾眉兼买心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17442,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳词十七首 其八","author":"谢与思","text":"梅蕊初含岭路香，天南迢递损柔肠。\n旗亭压酒行堪换，愁尔宵寒问鹔鹴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17443,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳词十七首 其九","author":"谢与思","text":"小时曾学唱伊州，从入朱门迥似羞。\n今日扁舟泛横渡，临风初得试纤喉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17444,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳词十七首 其十","author":"谢与思","text":"水竹居边风日妍，碧窗尘净袅炉烟。\n经旬群从相过少，抄就中郎传一编。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17445,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳词十七首 其十一","author":"谢与思","text":"野外危楼拂斗寒，名花如绮簇阑干。\n妆成金屋非无意，长遣婵娟带笑看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17446,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳词十七首 其十二","author":"谢与思","text":"园林清宴镇相亲，取次尝来海错新。\n怪底年芳游未遍，南音操得向时人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17447,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳词十七首 其十三","author":"谢与思","text":"晴光照眼石榴丹，懒对高春拂镜鸾。\n鬒发莫将梳堕马，主人新赐切云冠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17448,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳词十七首 其十四","author":"谢与思","text":"从得倾城映坐辉，自矜缘结此上稀。\n那堪天际双飞翼，却向西风怅独归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17449,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳词十七首 其十五","author":"谢与思","text":"远送将归夕涨生，兰桡摇荡酒初倾。\n交游都有生离恨，泻作尊前白雪声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17450,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳词十七首 其十六","author":"谢与思","text":"醉后衣裳点泪红，远天云树湿濛濛。\n玉人一去千馀里，回首欢娱似梦中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17451,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"艳词十七首 其十七","author":"谢与思","text":"还家恰度艳阳天，镜里容华好自怜。\n他日相思南国侣，可能重醉荔枝鲜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17452,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿百尺楼怀人同王教之明府赋","author":"谢与思","text":"众里欢娱泪暗挥，星河无语对□依。\n夜深楼上衾如水，纵有重扃梦亦飞。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17453,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古苏别墅怀人二绝同铿□弟赋 其一","author":"谢与思","text":"荏苒烟光逼岁阑，谁怜长路敞长□。\n闻歌转觉吞声苦，难向新欢说故欢。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17454,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古苏别墅怀人二绝同铿□弟赋 其二","author":"谢与思","text":"楼台如故尔何之，肠断梅花一骑嘶。\n知有愁心遥欲寄，不堪持赠道傍枝。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17455,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚泊","author":"谢与思","text":"薄暮荡城春水，维舟簇岸人家。\n□风乱扑孤幌，暗烛时弹一花。\n何处青楼游冶，当尊锦瑟纷葩。\n隔邻女儿未睡，拉伴喁喁缉麻。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17456,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同曹明府学参陈给谏吾德游厓分韵得山字","author":"黄淳","text":"梦寐三十载，仿佛两厓间。\n浴日惊鲸波，柱天思鳌山。\n非高亦非深，所忆殊跻攀。\n嗟予昔胡尔，正气薄区寰。\n形胜存诸夏，忠节垂大闲。\n世宁无板荡，而独忍间关。\n三公耻周粟，十万沈殷顽。\n向无厓海死，孰令夷腥还。\n断霞荒松枯，轻风吊泪潸。\n归航咽箫鼓，初月灿丝纶。\n英英烈丈夫，磊磊济时艰。\n临流倚长歌，盘器与犯颜。\n元阁坐王孙，金笼惭素鹇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17457,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再次韵五首 其一","author":"黄淳","text":"宋迹逢厓业已空，濒危谁奏补天功。\n黄龙雾散沈青海，白浪魂归泣故宫。\n岂有降旗随断锁，独追和议怨秋风。\n乾坤此闰无穷恨，一曲哀歌明月东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17458,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再次韵五首 其二","author":"黄淳","text":"楼船谁不解时非，历数羞于逆虏归。\n天地诸臣真激壮，帝王无土失灵威。\n诏馀槜李还思陆，史抱南山欲访韦。\n海日苍苍厓色故，松风吹露洒荷衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17459,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再次韵五首 其三","author":"黄淳","text":"天命狂胡然未然，腥风吹满汉山川。\n两厓身任纲常去，万死精悬日月边。\n荒冢谩歌华表鹤，游人长恨洛阳鹃。\n只今应与西湖鄂，来往旌旗度紫烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17460,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再次韵五首 其四","author":"黄淳","text":"鳄湖南去水悠悠，明月清风泪暗收。\n立国不遗晋孝鄂，捐躯应大鲁春秋。\n胡人敢尔仇中夏，蜀主犹能王一州。\n万里黄冠归不得，乾坤空向海门愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17461,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再次韵五首 其五","author":"黄淳","text":"刘徐两疏可谁呼，荒草扁舟听蟪蛄。\n海上英魂真不散，古来人极定须扶。\n浪回奇石磨弘范，雨过清祠泣赵孤。\n漫道江门非世故，一书千史正皇图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17462,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别","author":"黄淳","text":"及门何许时，别舸发朝雨。\n白日吹江云，江空啼杜宇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17463,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纸帐兰","author":"黄淳","text":"寒香侵客梦，爱此玉兰枝。\n兰香描不得，客心醒自知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17464,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庚戌三日即事","author":"黄淳","text":"地僻烟霞古，心閒岁月长。\n道人谈白石，孺子歌沧浪。\n洗竹惊猿鹤，惜花胜稻粱。\n太平天子德，稽首望宸光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17465,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄某宪副同年","author":"黄淳","text":"黄金台上春初煖，紫陌楼前花正妍。\n马首旋分千万里，天涯一晤两三年。\n道存岭海俱邹鲁，运会昆明起圣贤。\n谁谓丈夫轻出处，江湖廊庙两自然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":17466,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]